<title>USA: Rio Hotel &amp; Casino sets $125 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Rio Hotel &amp; Casino sets $125 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Rio Hotel &amp; Casino Inc was priced in the private placement market on Tuesday via Salomon Brothers, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER RIO HOTEL &amp; CASINO INC</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT  MATURITY 4/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.375 FIRST PAY DATE N.A. LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.601 PCT  PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 314 BPS   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
